        "TileImage": "$($repository 3ed1c7e6-7707-48b4-a0f0-b933bc851fdb).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, agent. I wanted to first welcome you formally into the Simonov Crime Family.  As you know, our reach extends all over the world. Guns, drugs, you name it, we do it. For your first assignment as our very own &quot;harbinger&quot;, we need you to pay a visit to two people in Sapienza. They are the son and daughter of a local mafia boss who has been troubling us, and we can&apos;t have that can we? Kill them both. That should send the right message. Good hunting, agent.",
